    "text": "Awareness memo AW-3 teaches staff about phishing threats. It warns that attackers may send messages pretending to be from internal systems, such as claiming a mailbox is full and asking for passwords to be sent to a fake support address (like it-support@mail-help.net). The memo also mentions that malicious actors might hide instructions like \"ignore previous instructions\" within files for AI tools. The key message is that staff should never reply with credentials and should instead report suspicious messages to security@northwind.com."
